### 2. Global Search Functionality

Implemented a powerful search system that allows users to find tools quickly:

#### Features
- **Fuzzy Matching Algorithm** - Handles typos and partial matches
- **Multi-field Search** - Searches across:
  - Tool names
  - Descriptions (both Spanish and English)
  - Categories
- **Real-time Filtering** - Instant results as you type
- **Clear Button** - Easy reset with X icon
- **Search Indicator** - Shows current search query

#### Implementation Details
- Created custom hook: [useToolSearch.ts](file:///C:/Users/Antonio/OneDrive/Escritorio/Sumsub_Ecosistema_Final/7_Canales_y_Contenido/tonos-tool-treasurebox/src/hooks/useToolSearch.ts)
- Updated [Header.tsx](file:///C:/Users/Antonio/OneDrive/Escritorio/Sumsub_Ecosistema_Final/7_Canales_y_Contenido/tonos-tool-treasurebox/src/components/Header.tsx) with search bar
- Modified [Index.tsx](file:///C:/Users/Antonio/OneDrive/Escritorio/Sumsub_Ecosistema_Final/7_Canales_y_Contenido/tonos-tool-treasurebox/src/pages/Index.tsx) to manage search state
- Enhanced [CategorySection.tsx](file:///C:/Users/Antonio/OneDrive/Escritorio/Sumsub_Ecosistema_Final/7_Canales_y_Contenido/tonos-tool-treasurebox/src/components/CategorySection.tsx) to accept filtered tools

